  "sourceFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Autoportrét (praktická maturitní práce)</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> June 2021 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Zadání a obhajoba maturitní práce:</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed--pdf\"><span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span></div>\n<br>\n<p>Výsledné portfolio:</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed--pdf\"><span data-i18n-protected=\"p1\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span></div>\n<br>\n<p>Instalace díla v ateliérech Nerudovky:</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<br>\n<p>Hodnocení práce:</p>\n<div class=\"media-row media-row--bordered\"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div> </div> ",
  "translatedFragment": " <div class=\"post-header\">  <h1 class=\"post-title\">Self-Portrait (Practical Graduation Project)</h1> <p class=\"post-meta\"> June 2021 </p> </div> <div class=\"post-body\"> <p>Assignment and defense of the graduation project:</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed--pdf\"><span data-i18n-protected=\"p0\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span></div>\n<br>\n<p>Final portfolio:</p>\n<div class=\"embed embed--pdf\"><span data-i18n-protected=\"p1\" translate=\"no\" class=\"notranslate\"></span></div>\n<br>\n<p>Installation of the work in the Nerudovka studios:</p>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-1.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-1.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-2.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<figure class=\"figure figure--full figure--center \"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-3.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-3.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>  </figure>\n<br>\n<p>Evaluation of the project:</p>\n<div class=\"media-row media-row--bordered\"> <div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-4.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-4.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div><div class=\"media-row__item\"> <a href=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-5.jpg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <img src=\"/images/autoportret-prakticka-maturitni-prace-obr-5.jpg\" alt=\"\"> </a>   </div> </div> </div> ",
